{"strongs": "H6449", "word": "פִּסְגָּה", "translit": "pis.gah", "root": "פסג", "morph": "N:N--L", "pos": "proper name, of a mountain", "gloss": "Pisgah", "definition": "פִּסְגָּה proper name, of a mountain Pisgah (probably cleft , from a natural feature of mountain; Dr Deut 3:17 ); — always ׳ הַפּ : ׳ ראֹשׁ הַפּ Num 21:20 ; Num 23:14 ; Deut 3:27 ; Deut 34:1 ׳ אַשְׁדֹּת הַפּ Deut 3:17 ; Deut 4:49 ; Josh 12:3 ; Josh 13:20 mountain in Moab, on northeast shore of Dead Sea, exact location unknown (compare Feš—a as a cliff on northwest shore, see Di Num 21:20 ); Φασγα Deut 3:17 +, τ. λαξευτήν Deut 4:49 , Αελαξευμένου Num 21:20 +. [ פִּסָּה ] see פסס", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6692')\">BDB6692</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6449')\">H6449</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H798')\">H798</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6691')\">BDB6691</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6693')\">BDB6693</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>פִּסְגָּה</bdbheb> <b>proper name, of a mountain</b> <highlightword>Pisgah</highlightword> (probably <highlight>cleft</highlight>, from a natural feature of mountain; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr<sup><ref ref=\"Deut 3:17\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(5,3,17)\">Deut 3:17</ref></sup></lookup>); — always <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַפּ</bdbheb>: <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ראֹשׁ הַפּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 21:20\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(4,21,20)\">Num 21:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 23:14\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(4,23,14)\">Num 23:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 3:27\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(5,3,27)\">Deut 3:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 34:1\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(5,34,1)\">Deut 34:1</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אַשְׁדֹּת הַפּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 3:17\" b